WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.130
- But let's talk "Grey's Anatomy".

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:03.050
Are there any surprises coming up?

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:06.470
- Yes, I mean, so if anybody
who watches the show knows...

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:07.580
Yeah (chuckles)

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.270
- [Kelly] Oh we had
some people freaking out

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:10.360
when I announced you earlier, so yeah.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:11.193
- Oh really?

00:00:11.193 --> 00:00:13.370
Well, this season they'll
know has been wild

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:16.190
because we had McDreamy
back like the first episode.

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:18.600
So we have, I've been telling everyone

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.170
and I think they just think
I'm promoting the show

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:21.360
to like watch live.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:24.990
But watch live because we have so many

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:27.360
crazy, unexpected people coming back

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.320
that you wouldn't imagine
and I've gotta announce

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:32.100
that Sarah Drew who plays
April Kepner is coming back

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.430
for an episode too.

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:34.263
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:00:34.263 --> 00:00:36.000
- We have a lot of surprises this season.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.253
- [Kelly] That's kinda cool.

